    "file": "rankings.html",
    "title": "用量排行 — 幻 MIRAX API",
    "html": "<div id=\"progressBar\"></div>\n\n<nav class=\"nav\" style=\"color:#1a1815;background:#fafaf9;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)\">\n  <div class=\"nav-logo\"><a href=\"index.html\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:none\">幻 MIRAX API</a></div>\n  <div class=\"nav-links\">\n    <a href=\"about.html\" class=\"nav-link\">文档</a>\n    <a href=\"pricing.html\" class=\"nav-link\">定价</a>\n    <a href=\"rankings.html\" class=\"nav-link\" style=\"color:#1a1815\">排行</a>\n    <a href=\"dashboard.html\" class=\"nav-link\">控制台</a>\n    <a href=\"sign-in.html\" class=\"nav-btn\">登录</a>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n\n<section class=\"slide bg-cool\" style=\"flex-direction:column;padding-top:80px;box-sizing:border-box\">\n  <div class=\"shape\" style=\"width:500px;height:500px;background:#E8702A;top:-20%;right:-10%\"></div>\n  <div class=\"shape\" style=\"width:400px;height:400px;background:#6BAFDF;bottom:-15%;left:-8%\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"slide-content\" style=\"margin-bottom:48px\">\n    <div class=\"sec-label\">Rankings</div>\n    <h1 class=\"sec-title\">用量排行。<br><span style=\"font-style:italic;color:#E8702A\">谁在用最多。</span></h1>\n    <p class=\"sec-subtitle\">按周期查看各用户的 API 调用量和 Token 消耗排名。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"width:min(800px,86vw);position:relative;z-index:2\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:24px;justify-content:center\">\n      <button class=\"nav-btn\" style=\"background:#1a1815;color:#f5f1ea;cursor:pointer\">今日</button>\n      <button class=\"nav-btn\" style=\"cursor:pointer\">本周</button>\n      <button class=\"nav-btn\" style=\"cursor:pointer\">本月</button>\n      <button class=\"nav-btn\" style=\"cursor:pointer\">今年</button>\n      <button class=\"nav-btn\" style=\"cursor:pointer\">全部</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);text-align:left\">\n          <th style=\"padding:16px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.35);width:60px\">#</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:16px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.35)\">用户</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:16px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.35)\">请求数</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:16px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.35)\">Token 消耗</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:16px 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.35)\">费用</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03)\">\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:#6BAFDF\">01</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-weight:600\">@devteam</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px\">2,847,392</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px\">1,204,583,920</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;color:#4DB899;font-weight:600\">$3,241.55</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03)\">\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:#4DB899\">02</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-weight:600\">@ailab</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px\">1,923,456</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px\">892,341,760</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;color:#4DB899;font-weight:600\">$2,103.87</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03)\">\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:#E8702A\">03</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-weight:600\">@startupx</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px\">1,234,089</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px\">567,890,240</td>\n          <td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;color:#4DB899;font-weight:600\">$1,423.32</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03)\"><td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.2)\">04</td><td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-weight:600\">@mlops</td><td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px\">892,234</td><td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px\">412,345,120</td><td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;color:#4DB899;font-weight:600\">$982.15</td></tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03)\"><td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.2)\">05</td><td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-weight:600\">@copilot</td><td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px\">645,871</td><td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px\">301,234,560</td><td style=\"padding:14px 12px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;color:#4DB899;font-weight:600\">$745.60</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<footer style=\"padding:28px;text-align:center;background:#f5f1ea;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);font-size:11px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);letter-spacing:0.06em\">© 2026 幻 MIRAX API · 开源 AI 网关</footer>",
